      "content": "That makes sense. To dig deeper into the 'friction' aspect for the report, could you expand on the specific variables that tend to destabilize a neighborhood's social cohesion during these transitions? I'm particularly interested in any observed patterns regarding the erosion of traditional community institutions or shifts in local safety perceptions when these demographic changes happen rapidly. It's important for the policy section to understand the risks of social fragmentation.",
